    "title": "Michael Klein, Author at Mississippi Free Press",
    "text": "Michael Klein writes about the Iran War’s potentially negative effects on the U.S. economy.\nMichael Klein\nMichael W. Klein is the William L. Clayton Professor of International Economic Affairs at The Fletcher School at Tufts University. He served as the chief economist in the Office of International Affairs of the United States Department of the Treasury from 2010-2011. He is a research associate of the National Bureau of Economic Research, and the founder, research director, and co-executive editor of EconoFact, a website that provides economic analysis on timely policy issues.",
    "summary": "Michael Klein writes about the Iran War’s potentially negative effects on the U.S. economy. Michael W. Klein is the William L. Clayton Professor of International Economic Affairs at The Fletcher School at Tufts University. He served as the chief economist in the Office of International Affairs of the United States Department of the Treasury from 2010-2011. He is a research associate of the National Bureau of Economic Research, and the founder, research director, and co-executive editor of EconoFact, a website that provides economic analysis on timely policy issues.",
